# Remotion

This repo is a Remotion video project. Follow `AGENTS.md` (includes the official Remotion system prompt).

- Skills live only in `.agents/skills/` (`.cursor/skills` and `.claude/skills` are symlinks — do not duplicate).
- Default: `remotion-best-practices` → then `remotion-markup` for JSX/animation.
- Look up APIs with `remotion-docs` (fetch `remotion.dev/docs/<page>.md`). Do not use the deprecated Remotion MCP.
- Animate only with `useCurrentFrame()` + `interpolate()` / `Easing`. Never CSS/Tailwind animations.
- Media: `public/` + `staticFile()`; `@remotion/media` for `<Video>`/`<Audio>`; register scenes in `src/Root.tsx`.
- Keep all `@remotion/*` and `remotion` on the same pinned version.
